<section id="s-validation" data-code="validation">
<div class="section-no">05 — Idea Validation</div>
<h2>What should we expect, and how would we know if it works?</h2>

<div class="vp">
  <div class="vp-head">
    <span class="vp-title">acceptance-rate.canvas</span>
    <span class="vp-hint">Select K — on-policy training helps more at higher draft lengths</span>
  </div>
  <div class="vp-body">
    <div class="canvas-wrap">
      <canvas id="acc-canvas" height="240"></canvas>
    </div>
